@startuml STM-5
!include _style.iuml
title STM-5 (System level) — Status of a CreditAccount\ncredit_accounts.status · v1.1 · 10/11/2026

[*] --> active
note left of active
  created with the Driver
  account (UC-ACC-01),
  balance 0
end note
active --> in_shortfall : session debited [balance < 0]\n/ block new app-billed sessions
in_shortfall : top-up credited [balance < 0]\n/ reduce shortfall
in_shortfall --> active : top-up credited\n[balance ≥ 0]
active --> closed : Driver closes the account\n[no pending top-up, no unsettled session]\n/ refund unused credit (closure refunds,\nSTM-10), write off the non-refundable\nrest, forfeit points, disable login
closed --> [*]
note right of in_shortfall
  Closing is refused
  while in_shortfall.
end note
note right of closed
  Refunds are created by the system
  at closure (requested_by empty);
  the Driver first sees a preview of the
  refundable and non-refundable amounts
  and the points forfeited.
end note
@enduml
